                                + "-"
                                + two(expDay)
                                + " actual="
                                + result);
            }
            if (input.getMonthOfYear() != beforeMonth
                    || input.getDayOfMonth() != beforeDay
                    || !before.equals(input.toString())) {
                throw new RuntimeException(
                        "[oracle:"
                                + id
                                + "-immut] metamorphic violation: receiver mutated before="
