            /*
             * Contract/oracle:
             * BooleanUtils.toBoolean(String) is a case-insensitive parser for the recognized
             * true tokens ("true", "on", "yes"); all other strings return false.
             * Therefore any 3-character string other than case-insensitive "yes" must parse
             * as false. A patch that merely avoids the crash but returns true would violate
             * this observable result.
